    <articleIntersectDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[We speak to Mr Lethabo P Chuene about the accreditation of his 2nd site laboratory, a first for Roadlab.]]></Value>
    </articleIntersectDescription>
    <articleIntersectImage>
      <Value>[{"key":"8f348014-153b-416f-97f4-870cd8c51e38","mediaKey":"44cbbc6f-3415-4c6b-be68-e4a50e7e9fb5"}]</Value>
