    </categoryPageToggle>
    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/fa6605751a82496b930a302e8ed8b76b"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/fa6605751a82496b930a302e8ed8b76b","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"SANAS Laboratory Accreditation"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/0484341870254064a1c63265c3b8e577","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/0484341870254064a1c63265c3b8e577","content":"\u003cp\u003eOur 5th accredited site laboratory, a dedicated facility serving a major SANRAL roadworks project on the R56 Matatiela in the Eastern Cape, is our 2nd site lab to be accredited under a team lead by Senior Site Laboratory Manager Mr. Lethabo P Chuene.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs someone instrumental to both our first and most recent site laboratory accreditation, we wanted to find out how these processes have changed, what has remained the same and what he expects for the future.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ng4mwrav/civil-laboratory.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/wacndltj/soil-grading-and-testing.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/5dlfyt53/materal-testing.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow are things since you accredited N2 Nqadu?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur N2 Nqadu site has been running smoothly since we obtained accreditation in 2022. The team has continued to uphold the high standards set during the accreditation process and has been successfully completing projects to the satisfaction of our clients.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe conclusion of the N2 Nqadu project was a significant milestone for us. It was a proud moment for the team. We celebrated the achievement and took the opportunity to learn from our experience to further improve our processes and performance in future projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat standards did you have to meet and how did you ensure compliance with these standards?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLike N2 Nqadu, R56 Matatiela had to meet ISO/IEC 17025:2017 standards. To ensure compliance, thorough training, quality control measures, and a robust management framework were established. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI also brought in a few female candidates from the previous N2 Nqadu Site Lab. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMs. Asavela Dwenga (Lab Manager), Ms. Aletta Quka (Trainee Manager) and Ms. Thandokazi Maliphale (Senior Materials Tester) aimed to achieve accreditation within three months of the laboratory’s establishment. They succeeded, setting a new company record in the process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow do you handle quality control measures to ensure that all testing procedures meet the required standards?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuality control measures are essential to our operations, including regular calibration of equipment, proficiency testing programs any internal audits to ensure that all testing procedures meet the required standards. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur quality control team also conducts regular checks and reviews to identify any deviations and take \u003cbr\u003ecorrective actions promptly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/bk0ofbfy/soil-testing.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCould you explain the training and development programs in place to ensure staff competency and compliance with ISO 17025 standards?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe prioritizes staff competency and we therefore have implemented a training and development program that includes regular sessions. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerformance evaluations are conducted to assess staff competency and compliance with ISO 17025 standards. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe training program involves comprehensive sessions, ongoing support, workshops and hands-on training to ensure staff competency and compliance. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew employees undergo thorough training before they can independently perform testing procedures.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/jgzflsz2/concrete-cubes.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/uxyepooc/site-lab-team.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan you discuss any collaborations or partnerships that have contributed to the success of accrediting the second site?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur success in accrediting the second site is thanks to internal collaboration within Roadlab Group, partnerships with quality experts, and our main laboratory quality department, as well as ongoing communication with relevant personnel within the organization. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese relationships have offered valuable insights, resources, and support during the accreditation process.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCan you share any examples of how  accreditation has positively impacted Roadlab’s operations or client relationships?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur success in accrediting the second site is\u003cbr\u003eattributed to internal collaboration within Roadlab Group, partnerships with quality experts, and our main laboratory quality department, as well as ongoing communication with relevant personnel within the organization. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese relationships have offered valuable insights, resources, and support during the accreditation process\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eCongratulatons to Lethabo and the R56 Mataliela team!\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"main-heading h1\"\u003eInterested in our work? Reach out to us below!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>In the last 2 years, our 8 accredited branches have been joined by 6 accredited site laboratories. Two of those site laboratories were accredited by teams led by the same manager, Mr Lethabo P Chuene.</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
